display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinStr}_L,\\operatorname{CountableIsoTypes}_L,\\operatorname{HP}_L,\\operatorname{JEP}_L,\\operatorname{AP}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_L,\\operatorname{FraisseClass}_L,\\operatorname{Age}_L,\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L,\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FinStr}_L\n&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L):\n\\operatorname{Finite}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CountableIsoTypes}_L(K)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists K_0\\subseteq K\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|K_0|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in K\\;\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in K_0\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{HP}_L(K)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in K\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{FinStr}_L\\;\n(\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak A\\to\\mathfrak B\\in K),\\\\\n\\operatorname{JEP}_L(K)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in K\\;\n\\exists\\mathfrak C\\in K\\;\\exists f\\,\\exists g\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak C)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(g,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C)\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AP}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_L(K)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\in K\\;\\forall f\\,\\forall g\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(g,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak C)\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak D\\in K\\;\\exists h\\,\\exists k\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(h,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak D)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(k,\\mathfrak C,\\mathfrak D)\n\\land\nh\\circ f=k\\circ g\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FraisseClass}_L(K)\n&\\leftrightarrow\nL\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\varnothing\\neq K\\subseteq\\operatorname{FinStr}_L\n\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in K\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{FinStr}_L\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\to\\mathfrak B\\in K)\n\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\n\\operatorname{CountableIsoTypes}_L(K)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{HP}_L(K)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{JEP}_L(K)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{AP}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_L(K),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Age}_L(\\mathfrak M)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\n\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{FinStr}_L:\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{FinStr}_L\\;\n(\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak M\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B)\n\\bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocallyFinite}_L(\\mathfrak M)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Finite}(X)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{FinStr}_L\\;\n(\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak M\\land X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L(\\mathfrak M)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{FinStr}_L\\;\\forall p\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak M\n\\land\n\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak M\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{14mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(p)=|\\mathfrak A|\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(p)=|\\mathfrak B|\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{14mm}\\to\n\\exists q\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{PartIso}(q,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{dom}(q)=|\\mathfrak M|\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(q)=|\\mathfrak M|\n\\land\np\\subseteq q\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Emb}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CountableIsoTypes}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrahomogeneous}_L","display":false}],"bytes":6183,"backlinks":[{"id":"5b4c86c70dd29331","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]] 的 $\\operatorname{AP}_L$ 使用初等嵌入；两者的映射资格不同，不能直接把它用在模型完备化判据中。[[17-df-fraisse-class]] 中的有限结构应用也不替代本条的全模型量化。"},{"id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本接口从 [[17-df-fraisse-class]] 上提。原先的 $\\operatorname{PartIso}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A$ 在全定义域情形下逐项展开，恰为上式：部分同构中的函数封闭条件自动满足，常元条件变为无条件保持。因此参数次序与原调用点不变。"},{"id":"c96ab493df8372c8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":5,"excerpt":"$K$ 是 [[17-df-fraisse-class]] 所规定的可定义结构元类；可数性是同构类型代表集合的可数性，不断言同构封闭的全部结构组成一个集合。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[17-df-fraisse-class]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-df-elementary-extension]]\n[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[17-df-embedding]]\n[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-existentially-closed]]\n[[17-df-filter]]\n[[17-df-filters]]\n[[17-df-first-order-language]]\n[[17-df-formula]]\n[[17-df-formula-consequence]]\n[[17-df-fraisse-class]]\n[[17-df-free-variable]]\n[[17-df-generated-filter]]\n[[17-df-generated-substructure]]\n[[17-df-homogeneous-model]]\n[[17-df-ho